  "description": "After a four year relationship, things are growing tense between Haru and Ji-Seo. They may have broken up, they may have broken hearts, but there’s one thing they can’t break: their lease! As the two try living together as friends, they’ll find that it’s easier said than done…especially when you have so many memories - and such little space - between you.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes 13 extra chapters.*",
